{"aliases":["CNN","ConvNet","Convolutional Neural Network","卷积神经网络"],"external_ids":{},"history":[{"agent":"claude-code","at":"2026-11-08T09:58:18.416339+00:00","fields":["id","how","why","kind","name","slug","what","layer","props","status","name_zh","summary","created_at","importance","tracked_at","expanded_at","merged_into","occurred_at","created_by_run"],"intent":"seed: CNN, LSTM, NMT, YOLO, SegNet, Image Captioning","op":"insert","reason":"resolve 无候选","run_id":"r_20261108_c26vf8"}],"node":{"created_at":"2026-11-08T09:58:18.416339+00:00","created_by_run":"r_20261108_c26vf8","expanded_at":null,"how":"卷积层提取局部特征图，池化层降采样，多层堆叠后接分类层。","id":"n_01m6x9gc2szxte6mca","importance":5,"kind":"concept","layer":"knowledge","merged_into":null,"name":"Convolutional Neural Network","name_zh":"卷积神经网络","occurred_at":null,"props":{},"reviewed_at":"2026-11-08T09:58:18.453978+00:00","slug":"convolutional-neural-network","status":"active","summary":"用局部连接、权重共享和池化处理网格数据（如图像）的神经网络。","tracked_at":null,"updated_at":"2026-11-08T09:58:18.416339+00:00","updated_by_run":"r_20261108_c26vf8","what":"每个神经元只连接上一层的一小块区域，同一卷积核在整个空间上共享权重，再用池化逐步降低分辨率。","why":"全连接网络处理图像时每个神经元的权重数等于像素数，参数量巨大且易过拟合。图像特征在不同位置通用，把这一先验写进结构，就能大幅减少参数。"},"relations":[{"confidence":0.9,"created_at":"2026-11-08T09:58:18.416339+00:00","dir":"in","id":"e_01m6x9gc4fjsgzfr3p","other_id":"n_01m5gnvyxxdf2h2063","other_kind":"method","other_layer":"knowledge","other_name":"Vision Transformer","other_name_zh":"视觉 Transformer","other_occurred_at":null,"other_slug":"vision-transformer","other_summary":"把图像切成块当作词元，再用标准 Transformer 编码的架构。","rationale":"ViT 证明图像分类不必依赖 CNN，纯 Transformer 作用于图像块序列也能做得很好。","sources":[{"quote":null,"title":"An Image is Worth 16x16 Words: Transformers for Image Recognition at Scale","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2010.11929"}],"type":"alternative_to","valid_from":null,"valid_to":null},{"confidence":0.95,"created_at":"2026-11-08T09:58:46.063862+00:00","dir":"in","id":"e_01m6x9h749js8tj1dd","other_id":"n_01m6x9h72re0vecyz6","other_kind":"application","other_layer":"knowledge","other_name":"Image Captioning","other_name_zh":"图像描述生成","other_occurred_at":null,"other_slug":"image-captioning","other_summary":"为图像自动生成自然语言描述的视觉与语言交叉任务。","rationale":"NIC 用预训练 CNN 作图像编码器，取其最后隐层喂给解码器。","sources":[{"quote":null,"title":"Show and Tell: A Neural Image Caption Generator","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/1411.4555"}],"type":"uses","valid_from":null,"valid_to":null},{"confidence":0.95,"created_at":"2026-11-08T09:58:18.416339+00:00","dir":"in","id":"e_01m6x9gc4c6rxcb4cs","other_id":"n_01m6x9gc2s7vfncxt1","other_kind":"model","other_layer":"knowledge","other_name":"SegNet","other_name_zh":"SegNet 语义分割网络","other_occurred_at":null,"other_slug":"segnet","other_summary":"用编码器-解码器结构、靠池化索引上采样的像素级语义分割网络。","rationale":"SegNet 是全卷积的编码器-解码器网络，编码器与 VGG16 的 13 个卷积层同构。","sources":[{"quote":null,"title":"SegNet: A Deep Convolutional Encoder-Decoder Architecture for Image Segmentation","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/1511.00561"}],"type":"uses","valid_from":null,"valid_to":null},{"confidence":0.95,"created_at":"2026-11-08T09:58:18.416339+00:00","dir":"in","id":"e_01m6x9gc49yjmzyvvr","other_id":"n_01m6x9gc2s7kttk9b4","other_kind":"model","other_layer":"knowledge","other_name":"YOLO","other_name_zh":"YOLO 目标检测","other_occurred_at":null,"other_slug":"yolo","other_summary":"把目标检测当作回归问题、单次前向直接输出框和类别的实时检测器家族。","rationale":"YOLO 的检测网络是受 GoogLeNet 启发的卷积网络，含 24 个卷积层和 2 个全连接层。","sources":[{"quote":null,"title":"You Only Look Once: Unified, Real-Time Object Detection","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/1506.02640"}],"type":"uses","valid_from":null,"valid_to":null}],"sources":[{"field":null,"published_at":"2015-11-26","publisher":"arXiv","quote":null,"title":"An Introduction to Convolutional Neural Networks","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/1511.08458"}],"topics":[{"id":"n_01m6x9gc2smdnp9e8d","name":"Computer Vision","name_zh":"计算机视觉","slug":"computer-vision"},{"id":"n_01m5eh84sr9t72dp1f","name":"Model Architecture","name_zh":"模型架构","slug":"